@startuml SWIMLANE_02A_EXAM_DELIVERY_GRADING_EN
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #1F3B52
  BorderThickness 2.5
  FontSize 22
  FontStyle bold
  FontColor #10243A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
  DiamondBorderColor #B8860B
  DiamondFontSize 20
  DiamondFontStyle bold
  DiamondBorderThickness 2.5
  ConditionFontSize 20
  ConditionFontStyle bold
  ArrowFontSize 22
  ArrowFontStyle bold
  ArrowThickness 3.0
}
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowThickness 3.0
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3B52
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #EAF1F7
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #1F3B52
skinparam PartitionFontSize 22
skinparam PartitionFontStyle bold
skinparam TitleFontSize 28
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 22

'==============================================================
' AIVES - SWIMLANE 2A (PART 1 of 2): EXAM DELIVERY & AI GRADING (English)
' Slide-sized slice: from "Start" until AI grading completes.
' Source: AIVES SRS 07/11/2026 + backend/Aives.Api, ai-service
'==============================================================
title SWIMLANE 2A - EXAM DELIVERY & AI GRADING

|STUDENT|
:Open the Web / Flutter Windows client and sign in (JWT);
:Select the session (Enrollment) and view the schedule;
:Join with the Session Code;

|Client (Web / Windows)|
:Press "Start" -> POST /api/student/viva-sessions/{id}/start;

|Backend / DB / Storage|
:Check enrollment ownership, session status IN_PROGRESS\nand the slot time window (BR-11);
if (Start preconditions satisfied?) then (No)
  :Return 400/403 - "Session not open" / "Slot time not reached";
  |Client (Web / Windows)|
  :Show the message to the student, allow retry;
  |STUDENT|
  stop
endif
:Create the Result (PENDING_REVIEW) and return the current question;

|Client (Web / Windows)|
:Record audio (WAV 16 kHz mono) or type the answer;\nUpload audio via the chunked flow (init/chunk/complete);
:POST /api/student/viva-sessions/{id}/submit-answer;

|Backend / DB / Storage|
:Store the Answer (Status = PROCESSING),\nupload the audio to R2 / local storage;

|AI Service (FastAPI)|
:STT - convert speech into a transcript\n(/ai/speech/transcribe-object);
if (STT failed?) then (Error)
  :Return error (EMPTY_AUDIO / TIMEOUT / INTERNAL_ERROR);
  |Backend / DB / Storage|
  :Keep the Answer, write the error into Answer.ErrorMessage;
  |Client (Web / Windows)|
  :Let the student re-answer or use the text fallback;
  |STUDENT|
else (Success)
  |AI Service (FastAPI)|
  :Generate a follow-up question if warranted;
  |Backend / DB / Storage|
  :Advance the question index; return the next question or follow-up;
  |Client (Web / Windows)|
  :Render the next question for the student;
  |STUDENT|
endif

|STUDENT|
:Answer the remaining questions in order;
:Press "Finish" -> POST .../finish;

|Backend / DB / Storage|
:Persist the submission state first\n(AiEvaluationStatus = PENDING);
if (Any answers submitted?) then (Yes)
  :Enqueue SessionGradingJob into Hangfire\n(Queue "grading", distributed lock);
  :Enrollment.Status = COMPLETED;
  :Return "Submission recorded, grading pending";
  |STUDENT|
  :Confirm the submission;\nwait until the result is ready;
else (No answers)
  :AiEvaluationStatus = FAILED, return the error to the student;
  |STUDENT|
  :Submit again or wait for manual grading;
endif

|Hangfire Worker (Queue "grading")|
:Run SessionGradingJob under a shared lock\n(one job at a time);

|AI Service (FastAPI)|
:POST /ai/evaluate/session - grade against the rubric\n(question, sample answer, rubric, keywords, LO, content);
if (Result matches the contract?) then (Valid)
  :Return per-question scores + criterion analysis\n+ overall feedback + study suggestions;
else (Invalid / error)
  :Return error_code (question_ids_mismatch, timeout...);
  |Hangfire Worker (Queue "grading")|
  :Retryable error -> retry with 30s/120s/300s backoff\n(up to 3 attempts);
  if (Attempts exhausted?) then (Exhausted)
    :MarkFailedAsync -> AiEvaluationStatus = FAILED,\nAnswer.Status = ERROR;
    |Backend / DB / Storage|
    :Record AiEvaluationError and the audit log;
  else (Attempts left)
    |AI Service (FastAPI)|
  endif
endif

|Backend / DB / Storage|
:Update Answer.AiScore / AiFeedback / AiAnalysis\nand Result.AiScore (still PENDING_REVIEW);
stop

@enduml